{"4844290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ascendring: League of the Risen", "steam_appid": 4844290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Where Death Became Sport</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one knows where the <strong>rings</strong> came from, who created them, or why those who <strong>die</strong> within their bounds <strong>return to life</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > What began as fear and superstition soon became spectacle. <strong>Arenas</strong> were built around the rings, <strong>rules</strong> were written, wagers were placed, and fatal duels became the foundation of a ruthless <strong>new sport</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4844290/extras/1f75a0cd5a56fb0ca72de0ccef4c79bb.poster.avif?t=1783612215\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4844290/extras/1f75a0cd5a56fb0ca72de0ccef4c79bb.webm?t=1783612215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4844290/extras/1f75a0cd5a56fb0ca72de0ccef4c79bb.mp4?t=1783612215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Choose the Move, Face the Consequence</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each fight, two warriors enter the ring armed with <strong>deadly weapons</strong> and no armor to protect them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You do not control every swing directly. Instead, you <strong>choose tactical actions</strong> that represent your fighter’s intent, movement, and attacks. Once your commands are set, the duel unfolds through <strong>realistic physics-based combat</strong>, where timing, distance, weapon weight, momentum, and impact decide the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4844290/extras/1ffa0521bb918faab8118f4314d6f9a1.poster.avif?t=1783612215\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4844290/extras/1ffa0521bb918faab8118f4314d6f9a1.webm?t=1783612215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4844290/extras/1ffa0521bb918faab8118f4314d6f9a1.mp4?t=1783612215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A well-chosen action can break an opponent’s guard, turn a desperate defense into a killing blow, or leave your fighter exposed at the worst possible moment. <strong>Victory</strong> is earned through planning, adaptation, and understanding how your fighter moves when steel meets flesh.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Rise Through the League</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start in humble arenas and fight your way through the ranks of an <strong>unforgiving league</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage</strong> your fighter’s path, learn from each duel, and <strong>rise</strong> toward the highest levels of the sport, where the crowds are louder, the opponents are deadlier, and death is only the beginning of the next round.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Where Death Became Sport</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one knows where the <strong>rings</strong> came from, who created them, or why those who <strong>die</strong> within their bounds <strong>return to life</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > What began as fear and superstition soon became spectacle. <strong>Arenas</strong> were built around the rings, <strong>rules</strong> were written, wagers were placed, and fatal duels became the foundation of a ruthless <strong>new sport</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4844290/extras/1f75a0cd5a56fb0ca72de0ccef4c79bb.poster.avif?t=1783612215\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4844290/extras/1f75a0cd5a56fb0ca72de0ccef4c79bb.webm?t=1783612215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4844290/extras/1f75a0cd5a56fb0ca72de0ccef4c79bb.mp4?t=1783612215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Choose the Move, Face the Consequence</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each fight, two warriors enter the ring armed with <strong>deadly weapons</strong> and no armor to protect them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You do not control every swing directly. Instead, you <strong>choose tactical actions</strong> that represent your fighter’s intent, movement, and attacks. Once your commands are set, the duel unfolds through <strong>realistic physics-based combat</strong>, where timing, distance, weapon weight, momentum, and impact decide the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4844290/extras/1ffa0521bb918faab8118f4314d6f9a1.poster.avif?t=1783612215\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4844290/extras/1ffa0521bb918faab8118f4314d6f9a1.webm?t=1783612215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4844290/extras/1ffa0521bb918faab8118f4314d6f9a1.mp4?t=1783612215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A well-chosen action can break an opponent’s guard, turn a desperate defense into a killing blow, or leave your fighter exposed at the worst possible moment. <strong>Victory</strong> is earned through planning, adaptation, and understanding how your fighter moves when steel meets flesh.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Rise Through the League</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start in humble arenas and fight your way through the ranks of an <strong>unforgiving league</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage</strong> your fighter’s path, learn from each duel, and <strong>rise</strong> toward the highest levels of the sport, where the crowds are louder, the opponents are deadlier, and death is only the beginning of the next round.</p>", "short_description": "Enter an immersive, brutal duel league built around mysterious rings that revive the fallen. Choose tactical actions, watch realistic physics-based combat unfold, and climb from humble arenas to the highest ranks", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4844290/c306343824c4f3673640ed75561083dbe96e50a8/header.jpg?t=1783612215", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4844290/37d12685caa599ae56a2076d9c93dfbd0874ea9f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783612215", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4844290/37d12685caa599ae56a2076d9c93dfbd0874ea9f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783612215", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64Bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-6700HQ, Ryzen 5 3500U<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2070<br></li><li><strong>Dir